---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Discovery | RetroPortDB">
  <header class="page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Review queue</p>
    <h1>Discovery</h1>
    <p>Automated discovery is intentionally not enabled in V0.1.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="prose">
    <p class="notice">Candidates will be stored separately from the catalogue, require review, and never become public facts merely because a repository matched a search.</p>
    <h2>Future process</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Collect a source-linked candidate.</li>
      <li>Verify game relationship, technical approach, and upstream ownership.</li>
      <li>Add curated YAML with evidence through review.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</Layout>
